      ("Day 2 · Zagora to Erg Chigaga","After breakfast we drive south through the Draa Valley and stop in Tamegroute, known for its green pottery and old Koranic library. We reach M’hamid El Ghizlane, the last village before the open Sahara, and continue by 4×4 across desert tracks and stony plains to Erg Chigaga. Camel ride and sunset over the dunes, then dinner and a night in a desert camp under the stars."),
